# 🏥 DoctorClinic Management System

A full-stack web application for managing doctors and patient appointments.

## 📌 About

DoctorClinic provides an administrative system for a medical clinic. Administrators can manage doctors, appointments, and view important statistics through a dashboard.

## ✨ Features

- 🔐 Admin Login
- 📊 Admin Dashboard
- 👨‍⚕️ Doctor Management
- ➕ Add Doctors
- ✏️ Edit Doctors
- 🗑️ Delete Doctors
- 🔎 Search Doctors
- 📅 Appointment Management
- 🔎 Search Appointments
- 📈 Dashboard Statistics and Charts
- ✅ Form Validation
- 🚪 Logout
- 📱 Responsive Interface

## 🛠️ Technologies

### Frontend
- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript

### Backend
- Python
- FastAPI
- SQLAlchemy
- Pydantic

### Database
- SQLite

